  "action_semantics": "Auctions occupy input t=0..5, two ticks per lot. Only wait/strictly increased affordable bid are legal then. Physical actions start at t=6. Input-state mask is applied before transition; movement attempts resolve against walls, old occupants and destination contention. There are no swaps/following. Claim expiry and release precede pickups but a newly available pickup may need the next input mask. Invalid or masked actions become wait.",
